  "name": "Containment Ring",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A filigree magical damper, worn day and night. It forces your fey nature into a permanent, artificial winter. Exactly one state is active at any time:</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th></th><th>Ring on</th><th>Ring off</th><th>Ring drained</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Surge roll</td><td>Once per turn, voluntary</td><td>Forced</td><td>Forced</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Containment</td><td>20, recovers</td><td>20, drops by 1 per spell</td><td>Drops, no recovery</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Charisma</td><td>Damped</td><td>Full</td><td>Damped</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Season</td><td>Winter, fixed</td><td>Follows your emotional state</td><td>Follows your surges</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Reroll</td><td>Available</td><td>n/a</td><td>Spent</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Putting the ring on takes an Action. <em>Drained</em> lasts until your next Short Rest. While the ring is on you always look like your default self. Once it is off or drained, its magic no longer shields you from the chaos, and you look like the season of your last surge until your next Long Rest.</p>\n<p><strong>Open (GM):</strong> the exact Charisma penalty is not settled yet and is a module setting (default 0).</p><p><em>Automated: use the Ring buttons in the Containment bar on the character sheet or on the token HUD to switch state. The linked effects below switch with it.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
    "type": {
      "value": "class",
      "subtype": ""
    },
    "requirements": "Sorcerer 1, Eladrin Wild Magic",
    "source": {
      "custom": "Fimblewood Academy homebrew (Eladrin Wild Magic)."
    }
  },
